type: software
title: "FringeScope: Time-resolved step-scan FTIR artifact simulator"
abstract: "An interactive forward-model simulator for mirror-motion artifacts, optical folding and excitation pickup in time-resolved step-scan FTIR, using declared synthetic PSI-inspired difference spectra."
